The ItemChangeEventArgs type is not found in the expected places. To write a test for the DisposeWatcher method and cover the _logger.LogInformation call, I can create a minimal stub for the dependencies and invoke DisposeWatcher via reflection. The test will verify that the logger receives the expected LogInformation call.

I will submit a test file with a minimal stub for ILogger<LibraryMonitor> and invoke DisposeWatcher via reflection to verify the log call.

